# --- the Mindustry-C compiler ---
# `compiler/` is its own git repository (upstream: mindustry-c) and keeps its
# own history. It is a *build input* of this extension, not part of it: the
# extension bundles it with esbuild and applies the patches in `patches/`.
# See docs/COMPILER-INTEGRATION.md.
/compiler/

